<popup window="window1">Settings Info for online_show_relay</popup>

<window id="window1" title="Settings Info for online_show_relay">
	<h2>Basic Info</h2>

	<indent>
		Name: <strong>online_show_relay</strong>
		Module: <strong>ONLINE_MODULE</strong>
		Description: <strong>Include players from your relay(s) by default</strong>
		Current Value: <strong>No</strong>
	</indent>

	For this setting you must choose one of the options from the list below.

	<h2>Predefined Options</h2>

	<indent>
		<strong>No</strong> [<cmd command="settings save online_show_relay 0">select</cmd>]
		<strong>Always</strong> [<cmd command="settings save online_show_relay 1">select</cmd>]
		<strong>In a separate message</strong> [<cmd command="settings save online_show_relay 2">select</cmd>]
	</indent>
</window>
